# Wireframe: SplashPage

## Purpose & Flow Context

Full-screen loading state displayed while the AuthStore hydrates (checks refresh token cookie on app start). Serves the first step of the App Bootstrap & Auth Hydration flow. Entry: app opens. Exit: auto-transitions to LoginPage (no session) or DashboardPage (valid session).

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Content is centre-aligned, single-column. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: None — SplashPage is rendered outside the standard app shell (header/sidebar). It is a full-viewport overlay.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Overlay | Full-viewport centred container | Solid background, z-index above all other content |
| Logo area | App logo/wordmark | Vertically centred in upper third of viewport |
| Spinner | CSS-animated loading indicator | Below logo, 8px gap |
| Status text | "Loading..." | Below spinner, 8px gap, `role="status"` |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Logo — brand recognition on cold start
2. Spinner — signals activity
3. Status text — accessible loading announcement

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                         [App Logo]                                 |
|                                                                    |
|                         ( Spinner )                                |
|                                                                    |
|                       Loading...                                   |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| App logo | — (custom SVG/img) | Static display | None |
| Spinner | — (CSS animation) | Rotating animation, auto-dismisses on hydration complete | — |
| Status text | — (HTML `<p>`) | Static text, announced via `aria-live` | — |

## Data Display

N/A — no data rendered on this screen.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Logo | Brand identity — reminds user which app is loading | Should match app icon/wordmark used elsewhere |
| Spinner | Non-verbal signal that work is happening | CSS-only, no JS dependency |
| "Loading..." | Announces state to all users | Kept brief; no specific detail needed (auth check is internal) |

## States

### Loading (Default)

The view described in the ASCII sketch above is the only state. Logo centred, spinner animating, status text below.

### Hidden

SplashPage is removed from the DOM once `AuthStore.hydrate()` resolves. No fade-out transition specified (can be added in hi-fi if desired).

*No visual — component unmounted.*

### Error

Errors during hydration do not display on the splash screen — hydration failure (no session) simply transitions to LoginPage without error messaging. Network errors on token refresh are handled silently; the app degrades to unauthenticated state.

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Logo at natural size, centred |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Logo may scale down proportionally |
| Mobile (<768px) | Logo scales to fit viewport width minus 32px padding |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `role="status"` on the status text container, `aria-live="polite"` |
| Heading order | No headings — single `<p>` for status text (not a document landmark) |
| Reading / Focus order | No interactive elements; focus should not be trapped in splash |
| Accessible names | Logo gets `alt="App name"` if rendered as `<img>` |
| Keyboard operability | No interactive elements; splash auto-dismisses |
| Target size | N/A — no interactive targets |
| Focus not obscured | Splash removed from DOM before next screen renders; no focus conflict |
| Non-color intent | Text + shape (spinner) communicate state, not colour alone |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
